1
00:00:54,760 --> 00:00:55,360
Ah!

2
00:01:00,480 --> 00:01:01,360
Don't be afraid, Miss.

3
00:01:01,360 --> 00:01:02,190
I'll protect you.

4
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:04,670
Hey!

5
00:01:05,150 --> 00:01:07,550
Poach someone's partner in private, punk.

6
00:01:07,960 --> 00:01:09,190
I'm still alive.

7
00:01:09,550 --> 00:01:10,590
She's not a widow yet.

8
00:01:10,760 --> 00:01:12,110
Don't get too cocky, I'm telling you.

9
00:01:13,030 --> 00:01:14,510
I just want to protect Miss.

10
00:01:15,360 --> 00:01:17,070
I'm afraid you're an unfit boyfriend.

11
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:21,920
While everyone searches the room,

12
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:23,360
remember to check the walls

13
00:01:23,360 --> 00:01:24,710
for any escape mechanisms.

14
00:01:40,230 --> 00:01:41,110
I'm telling you,

15
00:01:42,360 --> 00:01:43,630
that punk has his eye on you.

16
00:01:43,630 --> 00:01:45,280
It's definitely not just a simple crush.

17
00:01:45,920 --> 00:01:46,590
Got it.

18
00:01:46,800 --> 00:01:47,840
Just stop provoking him.

19
00:01:50,800 --> 00:01:52,190
Where on earth did you go last night?

20
00:01:52,880 --> 00:01:53,840
I already told you not to ask!

21
00:01:53,840 --> 00:01:54,800
You just had to push it!

22
00:01:57,760 --> 00:01:59,440
He's no good either.

23
00:01:59,630 --> 00:02:01,360
Humiliating his own girlfriend

24
00:02:01,360 --> 00:02:02,840
in front of so many people.

25
00:02:09,190 --> 00:02:10,280
I've already searched over here.

26
00:02:10,550 --> 00:02:11,880
No clues so far.

27
00:02:12,510 --> 00:02:13,710
Thanks, Miss.

28
00:02:14,440 --> 00:02:16,880
You and your boyfriend get along so well.

29
00:02:17,190 --> 00:02:18,230
I really adore you two.

30
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:21,070
Doesn't your boyfriend treat you well?

31
00:02:26,880 --> 00:02:28,550
My boyfriend treats me pretty well.

32
00:02:29,190 --> 00:02:30,590
He just has a bit of a temper.

33
00:02:31,150 --> 00:02:33,630
We live together.

34
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:35,510
He didn't come home last night.

35
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:37,230
I just asked about it,

36
00:02:37,550 --> 00:02:38,880
and he lost his temper.

37
00:02:39,710 --> 00:02:41,960
Are you feeling unwell?

38
00:02:43,920 --> 00:02:45,070
No.

39
00:02:45,190 --> 00:02:45,920
I'm totally fine.

40
00:02:45,920 --> 00:02:46,710
I'm not feeling sick.

41
00:02:48,230 --> 00:02:50,920
Dressed in luxury, yet acting arrogant.

42
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:53,800
From a good family, but with zero manners.

43
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:56,550
That's good.

44
00:02:56,920 --> 00:02:59,280
Then let's go ask together

45
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:00,400
what your boyfriend

46
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:01,360
was actually up to last night.

47
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:17,190
What is it now?

48
00:03:17,880 --> 00:03:18,550
I just want to know

49
00:03:18,550 --> 00:03:20,190
where you went last night.

50
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:21,670
Do you really have to get mad at me?

51
00:03:21,920 --> 00:03:24,190
I said we need to give each other space.

52
00:03:24,480 --> 00:03:25,550
You're being really annoying.

53
00:03:25,550 --> 00:03:26,920
But my friend told me

54
00:03:26,920 --> 00:03:27,710
that you were having dinner

55
00:03:27,710 --> 00:03:29,070
with another girl last night.

56
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:31,920
Your friend must be blind.

57
00:03:33,070 --> 00:03:36,000
Yesterday after class, I went to the lab,

58
00:03:36,150 --> 00:03:37,510
had dinner with friends after,

59
00:03:37,510 --> 00:03:38,630
called my mom,

60
00:03:38,710 --> 00:03:41,000
talked to my advisor about my thesis,

61
00:03:42,150 --> 00:03:44,360
and worked in the lab until three a.m.

62
00:03:47,920 --> 00:03:49,280
Since you remember it so clearly,

63
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:51,070
why don't you repeat what you just said,

64
00:03:51,070 --> 00:03:52,360
but in reverse?

65
00:03:54,710 --> 00:03:55,920
You're the one egging her on

66
00:03:55,920 --> 00:03:56,880
to pick a fight with me!

67
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:57,710
Fine.

68
00:03:57,710 --> 00:03:58,550
I'll say it.

69
00:03:58,920 --> 00:04:00,230
Late last night,

70
00:04:00,230 --> 00:04:02,070
I was working in the lab until...

71
00:04:05,550 --> 00:04:06,280
one a.m.

72
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:08,360
Can't keep going?

73
00:04:08,920 --> 00:04:09,710
Let me remind you,

74
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:12,150
you didn't say one a.m. just now,

75
00:04:12,630 --> 00:04:13,800
but three a.m.

76
00:04:14,070 --> 00:04:15,440
When people make up lies

77
00:04:15,440 --> 00:04:16,920
about what actually happened,

78
00:04:16,920 --> 00:04:18,710
they can't quickly recite them in reverse.

79
00:04:19,150 --> 00:04:20,070
You lied.

80
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:29,150
I know you value this relationship,

81
00:04:29,440 --> 00:04:31,360
but protecting yourself is more important.

82
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:39,760
Nice.

83
00:04:40,190 --> 00:04:43,440
Helping a lovesick girl.

84
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:44,760
That girl,

85
00:04:45,110 --> 00:04:46,800
something's off with her condition.

86
00:04:47,150 --> 00:04:48,630
I think she might be pregnant.

87
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:49,880
In an environment like this,

88
00:04:50,230 --> 00:04:51,800
I'm worried she'll get hurt.

89
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:22,880
What's wrong?

90
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:26,320
Does your leg hurt?

91
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:27,760
Should we just quit?

92
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:29,280
I'm fine.

93
00:05:36,190 --> 00:05:38,710
Is our time almost up?

94
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:46,190
Finding the clue on the flower

95
00:05:46,550 --> 00:05:47,760
triggers the exit mechanism,

96
00:05:48,110 --> 00:05:50,110
but it also started the countdown.

97
00:05:51,590 --> 00:05:52,960
Let's give up on this stage

98
00:05:52,960 --> 00:05:53,920
and get out of here right now.

99
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:54,760
The smoke is too thick.

100
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:55,800
It'll slow us down.

101
00:05:56,030 --> 00:05:57,000
We're already at stage three.

102
00:05:57,190 --> 00:05:57,760
Just wait a bit.

103
00:05:57,760 --> 00:05:58,880
Wait for what?

104
00:05:59,030 --> 00:06:00,880
The coin isn't as important as your leg.

105
00:06:01,320 --> 00:06:02,590
We can always come back next time.

106
00:06:03,030 --> 00:06:04,030
Just three more minutes.

107
00:06:04,630 --> 00:06:05,480
Just three minutes.

108
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:06,760
If we still can't find it,

109
00:06:06,880 --> 00:06:07,760
we'll give up.

110
00:06:24,960 --> 00:06:26,670
Cry, cry, cry! That's all you can do!

111
00:06:27,880 --> 00:06:28,760
Let me tell you,

112
00:06:29,030 --> 00:06:30,280
I've put up with you for long enough!

113
00:06:33,190 --> 00:06:34,320
You fucking hit me?!

114
00:06:34,590 --> 00:06:35,190
You just wait!

115
00:06:35,190 --> 00:06:36,280
Once we get out, I'm gonna fuck you up!

116
00:06:36,280 --> 00:06:37,760
You're damn right I hit you!

117
00:06:48,710 --> 00:06:50,190
The smoke keeps getting thicker,

118
00:06:50,440 --> 00:06:51,360
invisibly putting immense pressure

119
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:52,760
on everyone.

120
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:55,150
The room's designer knows human nature,

121
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:57,400
like they're pulling all the strings.

122
00:06:57,710 --> 00:06:58,550
I just hope nothing terrible

123
00:06:58,550 --> 00:06:59,880
happens next.

124
00:07:12,590 --> 00:07:14,150
He saw it after all.

125
00:07:20,070 --> 00:07:20,920
Gu Yan.

126
00:07:22,630 --> 00:07:23,550
What's wrong?

127
00:07:25,280 --> 00:07:26,510
I have something

128
00:07:26,510 --> 00:07:27,880
very important to tell you.

129
00:07:28,150 --> 00:07:28,920
What is it?

130
00:07:31,550 --> 00:07:33,440
Let me cross the line for ten seconds.

131
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:05,150
Hurry!

132
00:08:05,150 --> 00:08:05,840
Let's go!

133
00:08:05,840 --> 00:08:07,070
To the next level!

134
00:08:08,590 --> 00:08:09,670
Friendly reminder:

135
00:08:09,920 --> 00:08:11,670
Support NPCs will appear in this level.

136
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:12,920
Faint of heart, proceed with caution.

137
00:08:13,070 --> 00:08:14,150
In this round, players must

138
00:08:14,150 --> 00:08:15,440
use any means possible

139
00:08:15,440 --> 00:08:16,800
to evade the NPCs' search.

140
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:19,230
30-minute elimination mode is now active.

141
00:08:19,470 --> 00:08:21,190
Only the undetected can advance.

142
00:08:21,190 --> 00:08:22,000
Run!

143
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:23,680
If we don't run, the NPCs will catch us!

144
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:39,640
Congrats on passing the first 3 stages.

145
00:08:39,640 --> 00:08:40,920
Here's your commemorative coin.

146
00:08:45,390 --> 00:08:47,150
You can leave now,

147
00:08:47,430 --> 00:08:49,720
or book other games on other floors.

148
00:08:51,800 --> 00:08:52,800
Let's head back.

149
00:08:53,560 --> 00:08:54,390
Giving up here

150
00:08:54,800 --> 00:08:56,230
is already enough to get the coin.

151
00:08:57,150 --> 00:08:57,720
Okay.

152
00:08:58,190 --> 00:08:59,470
Somebody help!

153
00:08:59,470 --> 00:09:00,390
Someone's dead!

154
00:09:00,390 --> 00:09:01,880
Somebody come quick!

155
00:09:15,190 --> 00:09:16,000
Stop staring!

156
00:09:17,070 --> 00:09:18,520
Can you two hurry up and lie down?

157
00:09:19,030 --> 00:09:20,720
Zombies don't chase the dead here!

158
00:09:20,720 --> 00:09:21,760
Lie on the hospital beds and play dead...

159
00:09:21,760 --> 00:09:23,030
...to throw them off!

160
00:09:24,310 --> 00:09:25,310
Hurry up!

161
00:09:26,190 --> 00:09:27,190
Go take that empty bed.

162
00:09:27,190 --> 00:09:27,880
I'm smaller,

163
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:29,270
so I'll lie next to that dummy.

164
00:09:42,350 --> 00:09:43,390
Ah!

165
00:09:47,110 --> 00:09:48,390
Someone's dead!

166
00:09:57,190 --> 00:09:57,720
Hey!

167
00:09:58,880 --> 00:09:59,310
Hey!

168
00:10:03,800 --> 00:10:04,270
Shuyi!

169
00:10:04,680 --> 00:10:05,190
Shuyi!

170
00:10:05,640 --> 00:10:06,270
Wake up!

171
00:10:06,560 --> 00:10:07,310
Wake up!

172
00:10:07,520 --> 00:10:08,270
Shuyi!

173
00:10:09,230 --> 00:10:10,070
Please wake up!
